WEBVTT

00:41.680 --> 00:42.680
Blade.

00:45.120 --> 00:46.440
So here you are.

00:47.520 --> 00:48.800
Sophie.

00:49.610 --> 00:53.190
I've always wanted to go 
all out in a fight against you.

00:54.430 --> 00:57.660
Can I win if I don't hold back?

00:58.150 --> 00:59.690
Why don't we find out?

01:01.120 --> 01:02.750
Okay, then.

01:03.340 --> 01:05.250
Artificial Great Hero Power.

01:06.100 --> 01:07.500
Stop the flow of time.

01:13.150 --> 01:14.200
Ten seconds.

01:18.530 --> 01:19.780
How?

01:19.780 --> 01:23.680
You can attack me a hundred times, but if each 
does zero damage, that still makes zero.

01:29.480 --> 01:31.070
Adamantine Body.

01:31.070 --> 01:34.380
A technique that momentarily
 increases the toughness of your body.

01:34.380 --> 01:36.990
Since you stopped time, 
it was active all along.

01:37.900 --> 01:39.100
I see.

01:57.940 --> 02:04.000
I'm an ordinary citizen now,
 so I thought I'd be done with all of this.

02:11.190 --> 02:15.200
<i>I look in your eyes, and I'm met with</i>

02:15.200 --> 02:19.750
<i>A brand-new me and dream</i>

02:29.790 --> 02:32.500
<i>Bravery? Naturally?</i>

02:32.500 --> 02:35.090
<i>Polar opposites within the heart</i>

02:35.090 --> 02:37.760
<i>But, you know, wanting to have both</i>

02:37.760 --> 02:40.390
<i>That's the saga of human nature</i>

02:40.390 --> 02:42.950
<i>Oh no, don't mind me</i>

02:42.950 --> 02:45.890
<i>Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest</i>

02:45.890 --> 02:48.150
<i>A little more? Wait, even harder?!</i>

02:48.150 --> 02:51.060
<i>Going overboard much?</i>

02:51.060 --> 02:53.070
<i>Those selfish emotions deep down</i>

02:53.070 --> 02:55.650
<i>Bringing them to light is 
what friendship's about</i>

02:55.650 --> 02:58.660
<i>Spending adolescence duking it out with pals</i>

02:58.660 --> 03:01.910
<i>I don't wanna lose</i>

03:02.330 --> 03:05.210
<i>We're off to the cutting edge moment</i>

03:05.210 --> 03:09.040
<i>Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets</i>

03:09.040 --> 03:14.000
<i>You should laugh, since 
you look best with a smile</i>

03:14.000 --> 03:19.630
<i>On the ropes?! No matter 
what we face, et cetera</i>

03:19.630 --> 03:22.640
<i>Just sit back and enjoy it</i>

03:22.640 --> 03:29.830
<i>Whatever may come, I'll 
be here to protect you</i>

03:36.820 --> 03:39.990
<b>Episode 7</b>

03:37.610 --> 03:39.990
<b>The Springtime of Life
at Rosewood Academy</b>

03:42.660 --> 03:44.280
Hey, old man!

03:44.280 --> 03:46.490
I don't know what kind of 
magic or trickery this is,

03:46.490 --> 03:48.740
but can't we call it quits already?!

03:49.930 --> 03:52.250
I believe I explained it all at the start.

03:52.250 --> 03:54.000
This is no trickery.

03:54.000 --> 03:57.330
This technology known as virtual reality

03:57.330 --> 04:00.550
was made using a lost branch 
of magic known as science.

04:00.900 --> 04:03.800
Also, and I mentioned this as well,

04:03.800 --> 04:08.240
there's no need to use a blunted sword

04:08.240 --> 04:10.970
or to stop yourself at the 
last second as you do in reality.

04:10.970 --> 04:18.320
That is to say, it's practical 
training like you've never seen it!

04:12.840 --> 04:15.200
Dragons are the strongest!

04:15.200 --> 04:18.320
A dragon whelp like you dares to face me?

04:19.840 --> 04:25.320
Train as hard as you can in this practicum, 
until there is only one left standing.

04:25.320 --> 04:28.320
It's a fight to the death!

04:28.320 --> 04:30.450
What a sick joke.

04:30.450 --> 04:33.670
That's fine and all, but can 
you make it easier to distinguish?

04:33.670 --> 04:35.490
I can't tell the difference!

04:35.490 --> 04:37.080
Distinguish between what?

04:37.080 --> 04:39.410
It's way too realistic!

04:39.410 --> 04:41.020
The way it is now, even after we go back,

04:41.020 --> 04:43.630
there's bound to be someone who thinks 
they're still in virtua-whatsit,

04:43.630 --> 04:45.720
and slaughters their friends!

04:47.000 --> 04:49.220
That would not do.

04:49.510 --> 04:53.000
Well, how about this, then?

04:58.960 --> 05:02.990
Okay, keep on fighting hard from here on out!

05:02.990 --> 05:09.060
The last one standing gets the right to use 
virtual reality however they want as a reward!

05:13.620 --> 05:17.000
Guess I have no choice 
but to end this quickly.

05:17.280 --> 05:19.340
My lord dearest!

05:19.340 --> 05:21.420
The honor of facing you in combat is mine—

05:22.100 --> 05:23.000
Ow!

05:34.400 --> 05:37.710
Even as you tear me to pieces...

05:37.710 --> 05:39.690
how beautiful you are!

05:51.140 --> 05:53.850
Where are you, Blade?

05:53.850 --> 05:55.270
Hi-yah!

06:03.620 --> 06:04.340
Yessica!

06:07.960 --> 06:09.930
Give it up already.

06:10.610 --> 06:13.130
Ever since our days in the lower classes,

06:13.130 --> 06:15.060
you've never beaten us in a fight.

06:15.390 --> 06:19.730
That may be so, but you 
never know until you try!

06:19.730 --> 06:22.690
Yep. The winner is whoever's stronger now!

06:23.570 --> 06:24.690
So, Clay...

06:25.520 --> 06:28.080
Why do you refuse to lose to us?

06:28.080 --> 06:31.030
Huh?! Well, that's...

06:35.680 --> 06:36.640
Shoot—

06:36.640 --> 06:37.330
Ono!

06:37.330 --> 06:38.460
Kassim!

06:39.710 --> 06:41.710
Uchida!

06:42.090 --> 06:44.860
Huh? W-We won?

06:44.860 --> 06:45.960
We really won?

06:47.760 --> 06:49.020
Yay!

06:55.500 --> 06:58.140
I've been looking for you, Blade.

06:58.960 --> 07:03.480
I never knew that killing 
people was this much fun!

07:04.290 --> 07:08.340
I've been so stupid,
 holding back all this time!

07:10.850 --> 07:13.080
I guess I <i>did</i> promise

07:13.080 --> 07:16.160
that if you ever went berserk, I would...

07:16.460 --> 07:18.000
cut you down!

07:21.580 --> 07:23.960
Keheheh!

07:26.350 --> 07:27.480
Endless Flash!

07:39.070 --> 07:40.700
I'm Blade!

07:40.700 --> 07:42.020
We know.

07:45.170 --> 07:48.650
It looks like you were the 
last one standing after all.

07:48.650 --> 07:50.960
Well done, Parent!

07:50.960 --> 07:54.120
I couldn't even tell what 
he did there at the end.

07:54.120 --> 07:54.890
Yeah.

07:54.890 --> 07:57.700
It was so sudden,
I didn't even feel any pain.

07:59.420 --> 08:01.170
I can't believe it!

08:01.170 --> 08:03.560
To think I behaved like that...

08:03.560 --> 08:05.830
Oh yeah, you were laughing like, "Keheheh!"

08:05.830 --> 08:06.730
Shut up!

08:06.730 --> 08:07.670
Be quiet,

08:07.670 --> 08:09.550
you superorganism!

08:09.550 --> 08:11.470
No, I'm as ordinary as can be!

08:13.340 --> 08:15.940
Wallowing in misery is yet 
another part of youth!

08:15.940 --> 08:19.000
Youth is a splendid thing, indeed!

08:19.000 --> 08:22.870
This is all thanks to my brilliant idea!

08:22.870 --> 08:24.390
Your Majesty.

08:24.600 --> 08:30.150
Do you know how much trouble 
we've faced thanks to your brilliant idea?

08:35.090 --> 08:38.300
Oh? Going to have fun with it already?

08:38.300 --> 08:40.300
It's your right as the victor!

08:40.300 --> 08:41.790
Enjoy it to the fullest!

08:43.360 --> 08:46.190
Oh? Is that data of ferocious demons?

08:46.190 --> 08:46.600
Yep.

08:46.600 --> 08:49.170
Scattered all throughout the level?

08:49.170 --> 08:49.620
Yep.

08:49.620 --> 08:50.670
Booby-trapped floors?

08:50.670 --> 08:51.470
Yep.

08:52.170 --> 08:53.040
Hold on.

08:53.040 --> 08:57.720
Don't you think these settings are 
a little too extreme, even for you?

08:57.720 --> 08:59.130
It's fine.

09:00.670 --> 09:01.280
Huh?

09:05.350 --> 09:08.980
Can you make him keep on 
respawning, even if he dies?

09:08.980 --> 09:11.040
Yes, I can.

09:11.040 --> 09:13.240
How long should I continue his punishment?

09:13.580 --> 09:15.340
Until nightfall, then.

09:15.340 --> 09:17.240
Certainly.

09:17.240 --> 09:20.490
I'm starving! Let's go get lunch!

09:38.720 --> 09:40.390
Mmm! Delicious!

09:40.970 --> 09:42.820
Tonkatsu curry is so good!

09:42.820 --> 09:44.600
What the heck? It never stops!

09:44.600 --> 09:46.310
Hey, you two.

09:46.310 --> 09:48.050
When are you gonna get over it?

09:48.050 --> 09:49.480
That's right.

09:49.480 --> 09:51.500
Did something happen?

09:51.500 --> 09:55.300
Those four had a tag match,
 and the girls won.

09:57.820 --> 09:59.970
What led to the girls winning?

09:59.970 --> 10:02.510
Claire's gotten <i>way</i> better.

10:02.510 --> 10:04.140
Th-That's not true!

10:04.140 --> 10:06.570
As well as Yessica's do-or-die attack.

10:06.570 --> 10:08.270
A woman's gotta be daring!

10:08.270 --> 10:10.960
What led to the boys losing, then?

10:10.960 --> 10:14.580
Probably their complacency 
about their skills.

10:14.580 --> 10:16.970
They got conceited and 
neglected their training.

10:18.990 --> 10:21.300
Not mincing your words, huh?

10:23.190 --> 10:24.850
It's for their own good.

10:29.720 --> 10:32.980
My back! My back! My back!

10:34.160 --> 10:38.240
When did the king get around to 
building something like this?

10:38.540 --> 10:41.140
Oh! I've been waiting for you, Great—

10:41.140 --> 10:43.240
I mean, Blade!

10:43.700 --> 10:45.940
So, what in the world 
is this "thermae" thing?

10:45.940 --> 10:46.480
It says—

10:46.480 --> 10:48.590
Allow me to explain!

10:49.480 --> 10:50.160
Who are you?

10:50.160 --> 10:51.750
I'm Eliza!

10:51.750 --> 10:55.000
Well, in any case,
you'll know when you go inside!

10:56.620 --> 11:00.010
Welcome to Thermae Rosewood!

11:03.540 --> 11:05.510
So these are thermae!

11:06.140 --> 11:08.650
A nice, big bath isn't bad, either!

11:08.650 --> 11:10.180
This is fun!

11:10.180 --> 11:12.020
Sophie, let's swim!

11:12.020 --> 11:13.520
Is that a command?

11:15.190 --> 11:20.030
Three hero-level warriors were 
summoned here to dig these baths.

11:20.030 --> 11:22.030
I can't believe that old fogey.

11:22.320 --> 11:24.220
Ya-ha!

11:24.220 --> 11:26.450
Ya-ha.

11:27.430 --> 11:29.600
You're not Mao today?

11:29.600 --> 11:32.920
If I switched with Mao,
she would take off the swimsuit.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.130
What's wrong with that?

11:35.130 --> 11:35.920
What?!

11:36.290 --> 11:39.550
Not all the guys here are 
five-year-olds, you know.

11:48.880 --> 11:49.890
Oh, yeah.

11:49.890 --> 11:51.600
Where's Earnest?

11:51.600 --> 11:53.520
Ah, I bet she didn't come.

11:53.520 --> 11:54.440
She seemed against it.

11:54.660 --> 11:56.940
I-I'm right here!

11:57.260 --> 11:58.550
Mixed bathing?

11:58.980 --> 12:00.760
H-How indecent!

12:00.760 --> 12:02.450
How shameless!

12:04.390 --> 12:07.200
Looks like you're all enjoying the thermae!

12:07.200 --> 12:08.430
Your Majesty?!

12:08.430 --> 12:10.450
Please cover yourself!

12:10.740 --> 12:11.780
What are you saying?

12:11.780 --> 12:14.670
Thermae are meant to be entered in the nude!

12:14.670 --> 12:17.710
We need swimsuits, since it's mixed bathing!

12:19.490 --> 12:19.940
Gil.

12:19.940 --> 12:21.550
I guess I have to accept that.

12:21.550 --> 12:24.330
I can accept swimsuits...

12:24.330 --> 12:25.220
However!

12:25.220 --> 12:27.680
Don't wear a towel in the bath!

12:27.680 --> 12:28.720
What?!

12:28.720 --> 12:31.600
It's a part of our kingdom's constitution!

12:31.600 --> 12:34.230
Thou shalt not wear towels in the bath!

12:34.230 --> 12:35.220
Since when?!

12:35.220 --> 12:36.480
Are you an idiot?!

12:36.480 --> 12:38.480
Since three seconds ago!

12:39.260 --> 12:42.980
Gil. There's nothing of the 
sort in our constitution...

12:42.980 --> 12:45.360
I want to see naked girls!

12:45.360 --> 12:47.240
I'd do anything to see them naked!

12:47.240 --> 12:49.220
But if that's not possible...

12:49.220 --> 12:51.750
I at least want to see them in swimsuits!

12:51.750 --> 12:54.500
Don't you all agree?

12:54.780 --> 12:56.650
We do!

12:57.430 --> 12:59.480
That's the spirit!

12:58.000 --> 12:59.480
Hey!

12:59.480 --> 13:00.500
You guys!

13:00.970 --> 13:03.610
C'mon, Anna, can't you just take it off?

13:03.610 --> 13:07.010
Besides, hasn't the value of seeing 
you naked plummeted already?

13:07.010 --> 13:08.970
Plummeted?!

13:09.420 --> 13:14.080
I mean, during the simurgh incident,
you were running around town buck naked!

13:14.080 --> 13:16.100
That was because I was fighting!

13:16.440 --> 13:19.080
I have no clue why you're still embarrassed.

13:19.080 --> 13:21.610
I wouldn't want to take off my swimsuit,

13:21.980 --> 13:24.890
but what's wrong with taking off the towel?

13:24.890 --> 13:26.530
Everyone else already has.

13:26.530 --> 13:28.690
My lord!

13:26.530 --> 13:28.690
Yeah, yeah!

13:28.690 --> 13:30.450
Claire's totally right!

13:28.690 --> 13:30.960
Why does the Empress get special treatment?!

13:30.960 --> 13:32.940
Take it off! Take it off!

13:31.510 --> 13:32.280
Wait...

13:32.280 --> 13:33.780
I'm not taking it off!

13:32.940 --> 13:35.460
Strip her! Strip her!

13:35.460 --> 13:36.180
Take it off!

13:36.180 --> 13:37.450
Just take it all off!

13:37.450 --> 13:39.450
Lay bare your youthful, nude form!

13:39.450 --> 13:41.970
If you won't take it off, 
I'll amend the constitution!

13:41.970 --> 13:46.470
From now on, wearing any clothes 
in this kingdom will be—

13:47.340 --> 13:49.690
Hello! Splash!

13:49.690 --> 13:52.970
Everyone, I'm terribly sorry about this.

13:56.020 --> 13:58.780
Sheesh! I just have to take it off, right?

13:58.780 --> 14:00.590
I can take this towel off just fine!

14:04.480 --> 14:06.310
Don't stare at me too much.

14:07.220 --> 14:08.990
Sure, I won't look.

14:09.920 --> 14:11.000
U-Um...

14:11.800 --> 14:12.920
Do you have a minute?

14:14.530 --> 14:16.360
What happened earlier today...

14:16.360 --> 14:19.250
Y-You shouldn't worry about it so much.

14:19.490 --> 14:21.430
That was just a fluke.

14:21.430 --> 14:23.130
I'm sure of it, I think...

14:23.130 --> 14:26.700
No. We were just thinking about it again now.

14:26.700 --> 14:29.510
It was all because of our lack of skills...

14:29.510 --> 14:31.200
No way!

14:31.200 --> 14:34.010
You two really are way stronger than us!

14:35.200 --> 14:36.590
Hey, Blade...

14:36.590 --> 14:37.610
What?

14:37.610 --> 14:41.150
You know how people talk about 
"rubbing salt in the wound"?

14:41.150 --> 14:42.020
Yeah.

14:42.020 --> 14:46.150
I think I now truly understand what it means.

14:46.150 --> 14:47.030
Me, too.

14:47.250 --> 14:49.650
Um, so...

14:50.020 --> 14:51.740
I'm sorry for winning!

14:56.960 --> 14:57.860
You made them cry.

14:57.860 --> 14:59.150
She sure did.

14:59.150 --> 15:00.240
Yes, she did.

15:00.240 --> 15:03.000
Clay and Kassim are hopeless!

15:03.200 --> 15:04.600
Aw, man.

15:07.000 --> 15:09.230
Hey, cheer up already!

15:09.230 --> 15:10.760
All you did was lose once!

15:11.580 --> 15:14.010
You wouldn't understand.

15:14.010 --> 15:15.730
You've never lost to a girl!

15:15.730 --> 15:18.470
More like, you don't lose to anyone.

15:18.470 --> 15:19.880
Being a superorganism and all.

15:19.880 --> 15:22.560
I don't let it get to me when I lose.

15:24.000 --> 15:26.520
Well, I can't stand it!

15:26.520 --> 15:28.800
I wouldn't mind if it was anyone else.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.860
But I don't want to lose against Yessica!

15:31.110 --> 15:32.790
Yessica? Why her?

15:32.790 --> 15:34.600
Isn't it obvious?!

15:34.600 --> 15:40.250
I... l-like Yessica!

15:43.040 --> 15:45.040
I like Yessica, too.

15:45.040 --> 15:46.010
What?!

15:46.010 --> 15:48.670
I thought you liked Earnest, or Sophie!

15:48.670 --> 15:50.560
I like them, too!

15:50.560 --> 15:52.370
As well as Cu and Maria.

15:52.370 --> 15:54.680
I like you and everyone else, too.

15:54.680 --> 15:55.460
Eh?!

15:55.460 --> 15:57.460
Oh, I see. That kind of <i>like</i>.

15:57.460 --> 16:00.400
That's not what we're talking about here.

16:00.400 --> 16:01.770
How's it different?

16:01.770 --> 16:02.940
See here!

16:02.940 --> 16:06.580
I'm sure you've figured 
it out, but I like Claire!

16:07.260 --> 16:09.530
Claire... she's so great.

16:10.460 --> 16:13.910
She comes off as just your typical girl...

16:14.540 --> 16:18.260
but she can be ruthless sometimes, 
which is good in its own way!

16:18.260 --> 16:19.450
I see. I don't get it.

16:19.450 --> 16:20.660
Yessica, too!

16:20.990 --> 16:23.920
She seems so free and uninhibited,

16:23.920 --> 16:25.680
and I bet she's got tons of experience.

16:25.680 --> 16:27.420
I see. I <i>really</i> don't get it.

16:27.760 --> 16:31.650
But despite all that,
she's really kind and caring!

16:31.650 --> 16:32.900
Claire as well!

16:32.900 --> 16:34.800
I <i>do</i> get that part.

16:35.130 --> 16:38.050
So that's what was troubling you?

16:38.600 --> 16:40.220
The answer is simple!

16:40.220 --> 16:42.890
You two just need to get stronger!

16:43.310 --> 16:44.230
Huh?

16:44.230 --> 16:45.320
Listen up!

16:45.320 --> 16:47.500
Females are attracted to strong males!

16:47.500 --> 16:49.880
Get stronger, and they'll be all over you!

16:49.880 --> 16:51.910
Head over heels for you!

16:51.910 --> 16:53.650
Cu, be a little more serious here—

16:53.650 --> 16:55.380
Sh-She's right!

16:55.380 --> 16:56.160
Yeah!

16:56.160 --> 16:59.160
But how are we supposed to get stronger?

16:59.160 --> 17:01.810
That's simple as well!

17:01.810 --> 17:04.410
You just need special training from Parent!

17:04.980 --> 17:06.990
Ah! That's right!

17:11.090 --> 17:12.920
Mmm, so tasty!

17:13.140 --> 17:15.200
This cake is good, right?

17:15.200 --> 17:16.680
And chock-full of calories!

17:16.680 --> 17:18.930
Oh, no!

17:18.930 --> 17:20.580
No, no, no!

17:19.360 --> 17:20.580
Um, Anna...

17:20.580 --> 17:22.560
We're having a girls' 
night tonight because...

17:20.580 --> 17:22.560
Look, it's so delicious!

17:22.560 --> 17:25.060
Is it about Clay and Kassim?

17:22.560 --> 17:25.060
I can't imagine life without sweets anymore!

17:26.690 --> 17:28.800
It's really been a pain.

17:28.800 --> 17:31.280
They've been running away from us ever since.

17:31.280 --> 17:34.820
I don't think it's a big deal 
to lose to someone once.

17:34.820 --> 17:37.940
Seriously, getting bummed 
out from just that...

17:37.940 --> 17:40.410
Why are boys so fragile?

17:40.800 --> 17:43.760
Oh, what if we lost to them on purpose?

17:43.760 --> 17:45.120
You really shouldn't do that.

17:45.120 --> 17:47.370
They won't be able to recover from that.

17:47.370 --> 17:49.010
Huh? That's no good?

17:49.010 --> 17:50.880
What should we do, then?

17:50.880 --> 17:53.510
The answer is simple!

17:53.870 --> 17:56.010
Males are attracted to strong females!

17:56.010 --> 17:58.200
Get stronger, and they'll be all over you!

17:58.200 --> 18:00.310
Head over heels for you!

18:01.290 --> 18:05.000
Wait, we're not trying 
to make them fall for us.

18:05.000 --> 18:08.110
That's right. We don't see them that way.

18:08.110 --> 18:09.520
Huh? You don't?

18:10.000 --> 18:11.410
Hey, Yessica...

18:11.410 --> 18:15.640
Why don't we skip practice, 
and let those two get stronger than us?

18:16.530 --> 18:18.730
No! Absolutely not!

18:19.720 --> 18:22.370
Hey, are you two really okay 
with things as they are?

18:23.000 --> 18:25.360
Well, no, but...

18:25.360 --> 18:26.330
Mm-hmm...

18:26.760 --> 18:29.140
How about this, then?

18:30.580 --> 18:34.070
1,141! 1,142! 1,143!

18:36.330 --> 18:38.470
These are the lightest we have!

18:40.200 --> 18:42.100
Work those core muscles!

18:43.900 --> 18:45.270
That's amazing.

19:00.580 --> 19:01.900
It's finally time.

19:01.900 --> 19:03.600
Well, no matter the outcome,

19:03.600 --> 19:06.700
I can at least confirm that 
you haven't neglected your training!

19:08.880 --> 19:11.790
If we win this battle...

19:11.790 --> 19:12.710
Yeah!

19:12.710 --> 19:14.330
We'll confess to them!

19:14.330 --> 19:15.580
Confess!

19:31.720 --> 19:34.610
No hard feelings, no matter who wins.

19:34.880 --> 19:36.770
Are you ready?

19:39.920 --> 19:40.820
Okay!

19:42.110 --> 19:42.860
Begin!

19:42.860 --> 19:44.880
Claire! Here we go!

19:44.880 --> 19:45.370
Yeah!

19:46.220 --> 19:46.950
Coming at us?

19:47.240 --> 19:48.450
No, you don't!

19:56.460 --> 19:57.960
Take this!

20:04.100 --> 20:08.560
Blade, did you teach them how 
to use their fighting spirit?

20:08.560 --> 20:12.520
I just made them realize they've been 
subconsciously using fighting spirit all along.

20:12.740 --> 20:13.760
Also...

20:15.230 --> 20:17.350
Kassim is using wind spiritual energy.

20:17.350 --> 20:18.360
Hmm...

20:19.540 --> 20:20.360
My chance!

20:22.850 --> 20:24.490
Fire spiritual energy?!

20:24.840 --> 20:26.870
Did you teach her that?

20:26.870 --> 20:28.240
Just the fire part.

20:30.880 --> 20:31.570
Guh!

20:31.570 --> 20:32.500
Fighting spirit?!

20:32.500 --> 20:34.650
There!

20:36.500 --> 20:38.500
So it ends here...

20:38.500 --> 20:39.740
Next, it's...

20:42.400 --> 20:43.020
Huh?

20:43.710 --> 20:45.390
My turn!

20:52.480 --> 20:53.550
I'm sorry.

21:04.880 --> 21:06.320
Well, dang.

21:06.320 --> 21:07.870
You got us good.

21:08.610 --> 21:11.370
Thanks for not going easy on us.

21:11.780 --> 21:12.460
Yeah.

21:13.300 --> 21:15.670
We're going to get even stronger.

21:16.050 --> 21:17.600
You go do that.

21:17.600 --> 21:20.380
Fighting's not even our specialty, you know.

21:22.120 --> 21:23.380
Hey...

21:23.380 --> 21:28.020
Did Sophie and Maria teach you how to 
use ice and lightning spiritual energy?

21:28.020 --> 21:28.800
You got it.

21:28.800 --> 21:31.230
The other girls helped us out as well.

21:31.230 --> 21:32.140
Seriously?

21:32.720 --> 21:35.520
That's not fair, all of you ganging up on us.

21:35.520 --> 21:37.150
Don't give me that!

21:38.000 --> 21:41.570
How can you call it unfair,
being taught by the superorganism?!

21:42.080 --> 21:43.900
Why's she angry?

21:43.900 --> 21:46.990
And there's something 
I need to say to you two!

21:46.990 --> 21:47.660
Huh?

21:48.090 --> 21:50.820
Is it wrong to fall in love with someone 
unless you're stronger than them?

21:50.820 --> 21:51.950
Or confess to them?!

21:51.950 --> 21:52.910
You've gotta be kidding!

21:53.340 --> 21:57.980
That's just asking for way too much!

22:18.640 --> 22:23.700
<i>The sunny disposition that 
brings a smile to your face</i>

22:23.700 --> 22:29.450
<i>As well as the heroic sense of justice</i>

22:29.450 --> 22:34.620
<i>They may be a part of me, 
but that's not all there is</i>

22:34.620 --> 22:37.320
<i>That image of me</i>

22:37.320 --> 22:40.040
<i>Has taken on a life of its own</i>

22:40.040 --> 22:42.710
<i>Hey, wait up</i>

22:42.710 --> 22:45.130
<i>Won't you be friends with me?</i>

22:45.130 --> 22:49.820
<i>Let's shake hands, another self of mine</i>

22:50.480 --> 22:53.240
<i>The wounds we cannot bear alone</i>

22:53.240 --> 22:55.910
<i>The dangers that we keep hidden</i>

22:55.910 --> 22:58.580
<i>We're all hiding them within</i>

22:58.580 --> 23:01.570
<i>Standing ready to strike</i>

23:01.570 --> 23:04.000
<i>The shadow lurking beneath the light</i>

23:04.000 --> 23:08.280
<i>The muffled sounds coming from my lips</i>

23:08.280 --> 23:13.760
<i>They make me feel that I am alive</i>

23:13.760 --> 23:15.600
<i>It's a sign</i>

23:34.510 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.300 --> 23:39.980
<b>Less Than Human</b>
